                <syl /><neume facs="#m-9860f7e3-dd15-43eb-8757-88ede3b71e16" type="punctum" xml:id="m-ce119b79-31a8-4e29-b06a-029ceb900763">
                  <nc xml:id="m-e35b241a-9d5a-4887-a986-a81e47c484fe" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-e3beace5-ac1f-4031-ae49-65f33f0d7064">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-02b5be0c-f3fe-4081-8818-bc21d7f3db4e" type="punctum" xml:id="m-f3bfd5b2-d539-4db5-a230-d6e363bdcc79">
                  <nc xml:id="m-ed860b9c-7c76-4635-b1bb-efa91244a7ab" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-a4295afb-828b-44bf-8947-96037a6c5ec9">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-200857ad-a1f2-40d8-9e69-21e481432ade" type="punctum" xml:id="m-8b8bb41d-ee34-4cd0-9add-e0548b719978">
                  <nc xml:id="m-cf806396-bfbe-4a9c-997b-94901bda88d3" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-3e0dbc2d-b9a1-4ca9-be7a-a4ad821970d8">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-dc068faa-bc30-43aa-b3ae-de836613d7c8" type="punctum" xml:id="m-2a90fa71-d107-4e21-be7b-fb01bde9e98a">
                  <nc xml:id="m-de68b0da-6a64-4e9b-9f1e-ad0280446969" pname="f" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-93fc4ce7-8b26-4cd1-9bf6-005556b865cb" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-1c7527f8-ec60-4618-b1a6-cf20be15df54" facs="#m-fb77e9cc-0d32-4c16-b91b-cb8bcc591630" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-3d059e3e-bc9d-49e5-b275-2b13ba877281">
            <lg xml:id="m-e6b54240-717b-4dc0-8daf-925ad2324ad8">
              <l xml:id="m-f457a6b1-c3c2-4429-b45a-f4cdaea7fa4d" facs="#m-1b04283d-5661-40d0-8cb5-a777e1076aca" label="text-like">1424Friday after Passion Sunday. 7 Dolours of the B. V. M.</l><l xml:id="m-7b4d5ec9-4602-49eb-85f2-fbab8bd87b1b" facs="#m-80cd8b2a-c07d-44ba-8f4a-49e13f05188c" label="ambiguous">Hymn.4</l><l xml:id="m-0b26e36d-988e-44db-8a9f-30128ba2abbc" facs="#m-3237d486-d847-47c2-b476-76ad58d9e6e7" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-21b7038c-8947-4e0d-bcdc-afb798f10f23" facs="#m-013f2c09-4e7b-4e06-8491-91c396ab0c66" label="lyrics-like">Tábat Má-ter do-lo-rósa Juxta crúcem lacrimósa,</l><l xml:id="m-a9a0e881-c315-4644-ba60-49aa3f8dc4b9" facs="#m-29e120a3-086e-412f-aa28-579aa751d520" label="lyrics-like">Dum pendébat Fí-li-us.</l><l xml:id="m-a950e2cb-b3e0-4947-8bf1-53f376953287" facs="#m-c845d295-a8f6-446a-8da9-d06a100f0e1f" label="lyrics-like">2. Cujus ánimam geméntem,</l><l xml:id="m-54ce85f7-db6e-4721-a4b5-d8592dd9dee0" facs="#m-63c73ad8-3607-472a-bf31-c8d70d062322" label="lyrics-like">6. Quis non posset contristári,</l><l xml:id="m-85a090c9-40c4-4d5c-a613-9da973a9ce18" facs="#m-4f855f42-7fd7-4a1d-aed5-8118da8da4bb" label="lyrics-like">Christi Matrem contemplári</l><l xml:id="m-f30474ca-60b9-41f1-ae65-2611328de7ac" facs="#m-eb30a844-05eb-4cb4-917a-3bed388d378e" label="lyrics-like">Contristátam et doléntem</l><l xml:id="m-21c8386a-4566-4741-b8a6-1b90bbe2fc54" facs="#m-62e81be1-3683-4821-afe0-ce6702aec49e" label="lyrics-like">Pertransivit gládius.</l><l xml:id="m-a1f07226-7154-4170-9622-a87726f063df" facs="#m-ce5df24a-d623-48a0-bb8c-b26460ce8298" label="lyrics-like">Doléntem cum Filio?</l><l xml:id="m-6637d07b-1e34-43df-85ad-f79adbe20c6b" facs="#m-7d29c365-b05a-4a87-ad26-5ab4890f1676" label="ambiguous">3. O quam tristis et afflicta</l><l xml:id="m-46b5b78c-5ddc-4f5f-9922-2fd8f4c01f28" facs="#m-93ae43fe-3903-4a64-aec1-936bbd61994a" label="lyrics-like">7. Pro peccátis suae gentis,</l><l xml:id="m-952a6ee7-cd37-4597-88d4-e757bd8740a6" facs="#m-c17f7d42-9a9d-4cd8-8884-e92a32c53b57" label="lyrics-like">Vidit Jesum in torméntis,</l><l xml:id="m-73f13d81-78f7-41b9-8a5e-faa15a656ea6" facs="#m-68a3c532-7928-4248-9de7-feee51ed54ce" label="ambiguous">Fuit illa benedicta</l><l xml:id="m-71faabe6-d09d-4770-9f8e-f88f68f19b44" facs="#m-e6ef96d7-5775-493f-9601-711d8c2d320f" label="lyrics-like">Et flagéllis súbditum.</l><l xml:id="m-25e9a180-d4e4-49d6-886e-f8ff4cf887d3" facs="#m-7b240329-0f3a-4f88-a3af-6faf590c90c4" label="lyrics-like">Mater Unigéniti!</l><l xml:id="m-d2738855-fe57-415c-adcd-a56d47254772" facs="#m-b53945cb-9543-4399-a7e0-962fd17171df" label="lyrics-like">4. Quae moerébat et dolébat,</l><l xml:id="m-2bfeeb9c-c3e2-44ad-9b5d-0bffba208139" facs="#m-56975c2e-0dfa-4568-ab44-c201db910cd8" label="ambiguous">8. Vidit suum dulcem natum</l><l xml:id="m-055744ba-8634-4d36-a0fa-a34b639457e8" facs="#m-74a6a19f-2914-4840-95ed-7ad3ece8a581" label="lyrics-like">Pia Mater, dum vidébat</l><l xml:id="m-17c9aed7-54e3-4963-aed4-b7d09b25019f" facs="#m-7853459e-603d-4c6b-aaee-7964a5a94d0d" label="lyrics-like">Moriéndo desolátum,</l><l xml:id="m-4027fc4c-4fd4-4b29-84e9-2de94db91d06" facs="#m-ee5e2c44-f5b4-49ce-8505-9294776a5f95" label="ambiguous">Nati poenas inclyti.</l><l xml:id="m-8db81a97-c236-41c7-8e6a-f3e4e78cd412" facs="#m-13f46104-a401-492a-92e8-739f921e05a4" label="lyrics-like">Dum emísit spíritum.</l><l xml:id="m-766a5be0-9b0c-4d2a-b8d8-6c6b20de0bfe" facs="#m-1c275613-ae8d-4b1c-9591-b0408a9d0f92" label="lyrics-like">9. Eia Mater, fons amóris,</l><l xml:id="m-dbfe11a4-2d50-4ef1-98da-aaa8c267f69e" facs="#m-d1519343-74b1-48a0-b8fb-49e356bce731" label="ambiguous">5. Quis est homo qui non fleret,</l><l xml:id="m-bcbb9d8b-2728-49e7-b174-7c7e651ee274" facs="#m-3aaeee9f-4d90-41a0-8b99-e975ea43badb" label="lyrics-like">Mãtrem Christi si vidéret</l><l xml:id="m-fdb3d9d3-6df2-46e5-a139-7c2ed9588464" facs="#m-0a62087e-f475-4d94-85a0-12ca02858520" label="lyrics-like">Me sentire vim dolóris</l><l xml:id="m-f89300a9-5457-48f4-a3bb-139cddb50ea7" facs="#m-2f1b97f6-884a-4cf7-90cd-13949e397c6c" label="lyrics-like">Fac, ut tecum lúgeam.</l><l xml:id="m-12217efb-1a08-47f2-809d-56f01d409515" facs="#m-fdd17618-b93a-4c88-a67f-1f901dc536f1" label="lyrics-like">In tanto supplício?</l><l xml:id="m-d2c13c4f-c93f-4839-b7a6-6af33903cc24" facs="#m-351c9bbf-1ac5-489a-8a0e-7eeb09ff35c1" label="lyrics-like">10. Fac ut árdeat cor meum</l><l xml:id="m-d9239b81-c984-42e9-8bb7-4eabf8c28fd8" facs="#m-e34b57ba-51d6-4191-842a-545435562fe9" label="lyrics-like">In amándo Christum Deum,</l><l xml:id="m-3b95ab88-b13b-4c06-bb2d-49f18be115ec" facs="#m-ac360e77-82d4-4254-b5a4-af0aa108c37f" label="lyrics-like">Ut sibi compláceam. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-d4a3e953-3016-4063-bd5f-eea010cf6783" facs="#m-754986e2-df55-4764-be24-7a76f4f663f2" label="text-like">The foregoing Hymn is replaced by the following whenever the first</l><l xml:id="m-97252b33-b982-459c-919c-7ffa8f7f7054" facs="#m-6a2a888b-cded-4ebe-9bca-d068c402f050" label="text-like">Vespers of this feast have not been celebrated.</l><l xml:id="m-e911758a-99c0-431c-bfb9-bb1602201ea1" facs="#m-79bc7968-cb24-4fae-bdd9-5048a030068c" label="ambiguous">Hymn.E</l><l xml:id="m-10773f11-5205-4adf-bc6d-8042c7e8e244" facs="#m-d6678a68-6a39-474e-81a6-8ddab27433e5" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-de92bf95-0e94-469e-89ac-2198746a5bbf" facs="#m-cf526d9d-b606-46e4-8b33-f70aaa54d923" label="lyrics-like">Irgo vírginum praeclá-ra, Mi-hi jam non sis amá¬</l><l xml:id="m-48e886ca-8812-44df-8640-5aacef3e6666" facs="#m-af0c7721-105e-45ff-b454-1f637d3a2d69" label="lyrics-like">ra, Fac me técum plángere.</l><l xml:id="m-1d62b9a1-bec6-4f6c-a88b-8e42fda2694c" facs="#m-754a2f8d-9a41-4bdf-aac8-bab317289011" label="ambiguous">2. Fac ut portem Christi mortem,</l><l xml:id="m-f1a3e869-a807-4e75-8460-077371662554" facs="#m-03e45f87-1377-443b-a464-d52f4551445e" label="lyrics-like">4. Flammis ne urar succénsus,</l><l xml:id="m-8dec607d-cbc1-4243-b3f1-732cb0aa049f" facs="#m-7129f1fc-9c28-40e1-aa4a-670b3c395b71" label="lyrics-like">Passiónis fac consórtem,</l><l xml:id="m-9aa8d15b-51e5-492f-bb65-14cc2cd78c78" facs="#m-4ecab855-e8b4-4db4-ab18-d95a9f625361" label="lyrics-like">Per te Virgo sim defénsus</l><l xml:id="m-8dd86a25-3e44-413d-951d-3db08f10b0cf" facs="#m-1ca9cb42-321f-41a6-891d-63fb249917b2" label="ambiguous">In die judscii.</l><l xml:id="m-46743d56-b470-455c-8261-ba7f7d25428e" facs="#m-a587fc02-e8bf-4098-a1f5-c7ce530e3203" label="lyrics-like">Et plagas recólere.</l><l xml:id="m-0432e876-c954-438f-92bc-eafa34ea4b97" facs="#m-4901fcb0-7496-4995-bf62-860cb3525e2c" label="lyrics-like">3. Fac me plagis vulnerári,</l><l xml:id="m-72c665f6-a434-4efc-9b03-60dfc5700163" facs="#m-b56c1a00-4fde-422b-9c83-29a6eb25dc44" label="ambiguous">5. Christe, cum sit hinc exire,</l><l xml:id="m-4292a713-e40f-4540-9aec-fb1acd4fd6d8" facs="#m-e9c473dd-0de5-49e1-947e-02d77f3e696a" label="lyrics-like">Fac me cruce inebriári,</l><l xml:id="m-fbe0fd9a-61ce-4940-a535-5eb7666d64ec" facs="#m-0867a09f-b5df-4fe7-a44b-e370173b4123" label="ambiguous">Da per Matrem me venire</l><l xml:id="m-3f07b30c-d335-48f3-ba43-20b0f8bd7f16" facs="#m-9e82fbb8-2faf-40cd-9c72-b1a00e5d6041" label="lyrics-like">Et cruóre Filii.</l><l xml:id="m-d3c16c1b-a23a-45ff-a03c-874294e0952c" facs="#m-b12a1245-3523-4b42-8bf8-14d7ee58ce5d" label="lyrics-like">Ad palmam victóriae.</l><l xml:id="m-5f8dc709-5c7a-4a17-8213-0de2e584633a" facs="#m-41cc83b5-d214-4429-9258-c1268bedd0af" label="lyrics-like">6. Quando corpus moriétur,</l><l xml:id="m-09928cc9-d6f2-475b-8e7e-5568bae31e13" facs="#m-3f119c73-ba34-4998-a02e-7fa3747a27a2" label="lyrics-like">Fac ut ánimae donétur</l><l xml:id="m-5e5a4d09-be12-420c-8acf-5274996eb673" facs="#m-832d967d-261a-4b10-92c4-dc17d3d7bcec" label="lyrics-like">Paradisi glória. Amen.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>